{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slice Overdrive</strong> is a precision action platformer about speed, control, and clean execution. Chain up to three directional slices, dodge around lethal traps, and use quick double jumps to keep momentum and reach the portal. One mistake and the run resets!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET SLICING!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, skill-based platforming built around slicing, jumping, and tight movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-made levels that reward strategy, timing, wall control, and aerial chains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant-death hazards and moving obstacles that demand focus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community Levels to play creations from other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Editor to build, playtest, and publish your own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards to show off your fastest times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumping soundtrack that brings reactive levels to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points as you play by completing levels and publishing your own - unlocking avatars, outfits, and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983120?t=1759164563","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983120?t=1759164563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983120/fe7c0e273ef8ce26b536f000f9770b152eaca0ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759164563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983120/fe7c0e273ef8ce26b536f000f9770b152eaca0ff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759164563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Contr